# Course 7 (KEEP; docs/plans/bonanza-courses/KEEP.md): CLOCKWORK KEEP, a floating castle that is one LOCK -
# the first course that is not a line.  A DRAWBRIDGE on a timer (up as the play starts: watch it lay down), a
# PORTCULLIS its plate raises, a courtyard with the keep's locked DOOR in sight, the ROCKING STAIR (a timed
# see-saw) up to the battlements, POP-UP SPIKES along them to the ring KEY, one roll back down to the door, and
# the COG HALL: two quarter-turn tables over a pit, the throne across them.  The cross key, over the TRAITOR'S
# BRIDGE (down a third of the time), opens the TREASURY: exit 1.  Rubber throughout.  REFINED to the course
# guide (KEEP.md sections 10 - 13).  Written by docs/plans/bonanza-courses/keep/sketch.py --bbc --force; NOT in
# the build yet (no BZ_COURSES entry, no pathway pad).
course KEEP "Clockwork Keep"
guide                     # a REAL course: held to the course guide's checkable rules
width 128
origin 496
ball rubber
uses gate spike seesaw turntable
music clockwork           # its own song (2026-11-25): a tick-tock march in C minor at the machines' own rate (KEEP.md, "The song")
limit 99
target 90

# rooms (the sketch's sections), walls and guard rails
floor rect  22  37  28  42  flat 10   # S: the BARBICAN, 6 x 5
guard rect  22  37  28  42 side -x +x +y
guard rect  22  37  24  38 side -y
guard rect  26  37  28  38 side -y
floor rect  24  33  26  37  flat 10   # D: the DRAWBRIDGE's cells
floor rect  24  30  26  33  flat 10   # G: the GATEHOUSE, 2 x 3
wall  rect  23  30  24  33  flat 11.5   # the gatehouse's cheeks: low, so the courtyard is seen over them
wall  rect  26  30  27  33  flat 11.5
floor rect  20  21  30  30  flat 10   # C: the COURTYARD, 10 x 9
guard rect  20  29  24  30 side +y
guard rect  26  29  30  30 side +y
guard rect  29  25  30  30 side +x
guard rect  29  21  30  23 side +x
wall  rect  29  20  30  21  flat 12.5   # the stair's end wall: the ball waits against it
wall  rect  20  20  25  21  flat 12.5   # the north battlement's inner parapet (and the stair's other end wall)
floor rect  18  18  32  20  flat 12   # B: the north battlement, 2 wide
floor rect  18  20  20  30  flat 12   # B: the west battlement, 2 wide
guard rect  18  18  19  20 side -x
guard rect  18  21  19  28 side -x
guard rect  18  29  19  30 side -x
guard rect  18  18  32  19 side -y
guard rect  31  18  32  20 side +x
guard rect  30  19  32  20 side +y
wall  rect  16  16  18  18  flat 15   # the north-west tower (3 units: a floating face is at most 3)
wall  rect  32  16  34  18  flat 15   # the north-east tower
wall  rect  18  30  20  32  flat 14   # the south-west tower (low: it stands in front of the battlement)
wall  rect  24  19  25  20  flat 12.5   # a merlon: the walk is one lane here, the flag's
wall  rect  18  20  19  21  flat 12.5   # a merlon: the flag's lane is the inner one, beside the parapet
wall  rect  20  21  21  23  flat 12.5   # a buttress: a spiked cell may not stand beside a LOWER floor (SPEC.md 130.38.4)
floor rect  30  24  32  25  flat 10   # the door's sill and the keep's passage
guard rect  31  24  32  25 side -y +y
wall  rect  30  23  31  24  flat 12   # the door's jamb
floor rect  32  22  35  27  flat 10   # H: the COG HALL's near floor, 3 x 5
floor rect  35  24  37  26  flat 10   # the first cog (a 2 x 2 table)
floor rect  37  24  38  26  flat 10   # the island between the cogs
floor rect  38  24  40  26  flat 10   # the second cog
floor rect  40  22  43  28  flat 10   # T: the THRONE's dais, 3 x 6
guard rect  32  22  35  23 side -y
guard rect  32  26  35  27 side +y
guard rect  32  22  33  24 side -x
guard rect  32  25  33  27 side -x
guard rect  34  22  35  24 side +x
guard rect  34  26  35  27 side +x
guard rect  40  22  41  24 side -x
guard rect  40  26  41  28 side -x
guard rect  40  27  43  28 side +y
guard rect  42  22  43  28 side +x
guard rect  40  22  41  23 side -y
guard rect  42  22  43  23 side -y
floor rect  15  28  18  29  flat 12   # the TRAITOR'S BRIDGE's cells
floor rect  12  27  15  30  flat 12   # the turret, 3 x 3
guard rect  12  27  15  30 side -x -y +y
guard rect  14  27  15  28 side +x
guard rect  14  29  15  30 side +x
floor rect  41  21  42  22  flat 10   # the treasury's gate cell
guard rect  41  21  42  22 side -x +x
floor rect  40  18  43  21  flat 10   # the TREASURY, 3 x 3
guard rect  40  18  43  21 side -x -y +x
guard rect  40  20  41  21 side +y
guard rect  42  20  43  21 side +y
float rect  10  14  45  44
float rect  24  33  26  37 thick 0.5
float rect  16  16  18  18 thick 3
float rect  32  16  34  18 thick 3
float rect  18  30  20  32 thick 2
float rect  15  28  18  29 thick 0.5

prop bridge 24 33 26 37 period 256 on 160 seed 216 style picket
prop plate 24 31 channel plus
prop gate 24 30 channel plus along y art keep_port
surface sand rect 20 23 22 26
seesaw 25 20 29 21 along x pivot 11 rest + period 128 flat 16
prop popspikes 22 18 period 128 on 64 seed 0
prop popspikes 22 19 period 128 on 64 seed 1
prop popspikes 18 22 period 128 on 64 seed 64
prop popspikes 19 22 period 128 on 64 seed 65
prop key 19 24 channel ring
prop gate 30 24 channel ring along x art keep_door
prop turntable 35 24 size 2 fill oo/..
prop turntable 38 24 size 2 fill oo/.. seed 96
prop bridge 15 28 18 29 period 256 on 96 seed 96 style portcullis
prop key 13 28 channel cross
prop gate 41 21 channel cross along y art keep_vault
# ART (docs/plans/bonanza-courses/keep/art.py draws the files and places them: ART.md)
art keep_wait.bba 257 297
art keep_plate.bba 393 296
art keep_up0.bba 599 240
art keep_up1.bba 551 216
art keep_hay.bba 406 191
art keep_carpet.bba 611 294
art keep_throne.bba 694 370
art keep_tower0.bba 726 173
art keep_tower1.bba 278 220

goal  rect 41 26 43 28  flat 10
goal  rect 41 18 42 20  flat 10 exit 1 hidden
start 24 40
checkpoint 24 18 ball rubber   # flag 0
checkpoint 19 20 ball rubber   # flag 1
checkpoint 31 24 ball rubber   # flag 2
checkpoint 18 28 ball rubber   # flag 3
checkpoint 14 28 ball rubber   # flag 4

# clocks: on a corner of a floor off the way, or on a tile one out from it
clock 22 39 frame hourp   # start: full, a padlock
clock 18 18 frame hourk ink white   # tower: half run, a key
clock 40 22 frame hourc ink white   # throne: run out, a crown

